   "text": "🏆 What it gives: one text (draft/), every view built from it · C1 one Section canvas every\nstep fills, column by column: logic left, text middle, evidence and edits right (✨1) · C2 every\nchange old → new, and only you accept it (✨2) · C3 a quick loop: notes in, canvas out in\nseconds; the full rubric only on ask (✨3).",
