   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Before any sentence: §1 Structure, each\nparagraph's job and each Bullet. It is often\nshaped in the Studio: what you settle there is\nwritten into the Task's §1 at once (D25), so this\ntab already shows it; the agent fills what the\nStudio left open, and you sign.",
