   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Write like a first draft (D26): from the signed plan,\n§2 Scratch says what each paragraph will say,\nthen §3 Draft is the first full text, written where the\nthought goes, with no rules yet. The evidence\nagent proposes cards beside you as you write;\nthe rules come in Revise. The same text is the\nStudio canvas's middle.",
   "originalText": "Write like a first draft (D26): from the signed plan,\n§2 Scratch says what each paragraph will say,\nthen §3 Draft is the first full text, written where the\nthought goes, with no rules yet. The evidence\nagent proposes cards beside you as you write;\nthe rules come in Revise. The same text is the\nStudio canvas's middle.",
