   "text": "Claim first (D22): once you sign the plan, each\nclaim that needs a value, a citation or a figure\ngets a card: have it, ask a Job, ask a person, or\nsoften the claim; you tick the asks and their Runs\ngo on while you write. After Write, a reader pass\nadds cards for claims the plan missed. CITE\ncomes from a discovery Task or Job, WORK from\na work Task or Job; each names its Run,\nbNN.jNN.tNN.rNN.",
   "originalText": "Claim first (D22): once you sign the plan, each\nclaim that needs a value, a citation or a figure\ngets a card: have it, ask a Job, ask a person, or\nsoften the claim; you tick the asks and their Runs\ngo on while you write. After Write, a reader pass\nadds cards for claims the plan missed. CITE\ncomes from a discovery Task or Job, WORK from\na work Task or Job; each names its Run,\nbNN.jNN.tNN.rNN.",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
