   "text": "Pass by pass on the Section canvas: your notes\ngo in with the prompt, the agent writes Revise\ncards (why, original, expected), the canvas is\nrebuilt, you accept each card. Quick by default;\nthe full rubric only on ask.",
   "originalText": "Pass by pass on the Section canvas: your notes\ngo in with the prompt, the agent writes Revise\ncards (why, original, expected), the canvas is\nrebuilt, you accept each card. Quick by default;\nthe full rubric only on ask.",
