   "text": "🎨 Studio: one studio/ for Block, Job and Task; a Task's Studio tab shows the Block's sNN topics in its Job's group (s06\nfor C5), the same cards the Block's Studio shows",
   "originalText": "🎨 Studio: one studio/ for Block, Job and Task; a Task's Studio tab shows the Block's sNN topics in its Job's group (s06\nfor C5), the same cards the Block's Studio shows",
